          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "NONE",
            "OWNER",
            "OWNER_REVIEWERS",
            "ALL"
          ],
          "description": "Notify handling that defines to whom email notifications should be sent when the combined check state changes due to rerunning this check. Allowed values are NONE, OWNER, OWNER_REVIEWERS and ALL. If not set, the default is OWNER."
